CONTEXT School NAMED Library INCLUDES Library FROM "../contexts/library.adl"

CONTEXT School IN ENGLISH

PURPOSE CONTEXT School
{+ NAMED after the including context: the school lands on the database Library, where the library already is. +}

RELATION pupil[Pupil*Library.Member] [UNI,TOT]
POPULATION pupil[Pupil*Library.Member] CONTAINS [ ("pupil1", "m1") ]
ENDCONTEXT
